    "body": "Merged `main` (8f30bee) into the branch to clear the conflict with #21's blade footprint in `crates/app/src/stock_sim.rs` (3ba842f). The resolution keeps both: a lathe plan's display radius is `LathePlan::feature` (main's change), and every other tool still sweeps `tool_law::cutting_radius` (a tap its thread's core, this PR).\n\nRe-ran the quick gate's plan for this diff on the merge (app lib, `lathe_field_sim`, `lathe_field_tools`, `post_not_judged`, `posting`, `real_tip_contour`, `rotary_field_parity`, `stock_engine_agreement`, `stock_export`, `stock_field_cost`, `stock_sim_document`, `stock_view`, `tap_sim`, `tool_law`, `verify`): 162 pass, 7 ignored (ignored on `main` too). `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\nStill a draft: the generator-verify half described on #266 needs the owner's call (core radius for the cutting laws only, and the tapped-hole convention in `solid_law_goldens.rs`).",
